---
title: "The Zero Fog - full session"
permalink: /session/
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{# A plain, always-open copy of the FULL workshop master (3488 s), for people who need to review
   the funnel rather than be sold by it: partners, the friends lane, anyone we hand the link to.

   Why it exists as its own address. The room (`wr-room.js`) is one person, one session, one
   server-computed deadline - correct for a registrant, useless for somebody who has to be able to
   open it on a Tuesday and scrub. `/start/thanks/` and `/welcome/` carry the BUYER CUT, which
   stops at 3058.7 s, before the offer - also wrong here, because reviewing the funnel means
   seeing the offer.

   So this page is the master, uncut, no token, no countdown, with our own speed control. It is
   noindex and unlinked: the address is the access. That is the same exposure the file already
   carries - the CloudFront URL sits in the public repo either way. #}

{% block head_extras %}
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<meta name="description" content="The full recorded session.">
<script>window.ZF_NO_META_PIXEL = true;</script>
{% endblock %}

{% block page_css %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/css/pages/welcome-2.css' | v }}">
<style>
  .session-wrap { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 16px 64px; }
  .session-video { width: 100%; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .session-video video { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border-accent); background: #0d0d0d; }
  .session-heading { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.25em; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; }
  .session-note { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .speed-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .speed-label { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; font-weight: 700; }
  .speed-btn { font: inherit; font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer;
               border: 1px solid var(--border-accent); background: transparent; color: var(--muted); }
  .speed-btn[aria-pressed="true"] { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

<a href="/" class="brand">The Zero Fog</a>
<button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" onclick="toggleTheme()">Light</button>

<section class="session-wrap">
  <p class="session-heading">The full session</p>

  <div class="session-video">
    <video id="sessionVid" controls playsinline preload="metadata"
           poster="/assets/img/replay-poster.jpg">
      <source src="https://d1yei2z3i6k35z.cloudfront.net/17244934/6a832c1d0fc977.60695874_FullWebV2-refund-fixed.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      <track kind="captions" src="/assets/captions/workshop-v2.vtt" srclang="en" label="English">
    </video>
  </div>

  <div class="speed-row" role="group" aria-label="Playback speed">
    <span class="speed-label">Speed</span>
    <button type="button" class="speed-btn" data-rate="1" aria-pressed="true">1x</button>
    <button type="button" class="speed-btn" data-rate="1.25" aria-pressed="false">1.25x</button>
    <button type="button" class="speed-btn" data-rate="1.5" aria-pressed="false">1.5x</button>
    <button type="button" class="speed-btn" data-rate="1.75" aria-pressed="false">1.75x</button>
    <button type="button" class="speed-btn" data-rate="2" aria-pressed="false">2x</button>
  </div>

  <p class="session-note">The whole thing, uncut, including the offer at the end - this is what a
  registrant sees. No countdown: open it whenever, scrub, speed it up, come back to it. Captions
  are in the player.</p>
</section>

{% endblock %}

{% block page_scripts %}
<script>
(function () {
  var v = document.getElementById('sessionVid');
  if (!v) return;
  var rate = 1;
  var btns = document.querySelectorAll('.speed-btn');
  function apply(r) {
    rate = r;
    try { v.playbackRate = r; } catch (e) {}
    for (var i = 0; i < btns.length; i++) {
      btns[i].setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(parseFloat(btns[i].dataset.rate) === r));
    }
  }
  for (var i = 0; i < btns.length; i++) {
    btns[i].addEventListener('click', function () { apply(parseFloat(this.dataset.rate)); });
  }
  v.addEventListener('loadedmetadata', function () { if (rate !== 1) { try { v.playbackRate = rate; } catch (e) {} } });
})();
</script>
{% endblock %}
